# dsk_camera: the CAMERA SNAP of Teropoly (owner 2026-11-08 "cam should snap to entity esp p1") through the REAL deskopoly_driver, in a scratch house, with a fake board session (bv_state.txt, interact_relay.txt) and a fake xelector piece.
# What a human sees is the 3D camera (the follow camera sits behind the xelector); what the driver can be asked is: move the xelector pos_x/pos_y, mirror it in bv_state selector_x/y, append ONE redraw nudge (126) to the session relay.
# The PICTURE is proved live (tests the real engine; PNGs in the commit message): this case pins the arithmetic and the guards. THE GAME is the 47-row engine-made ledger fixture of dsk_tradeui (p1 = human, round 5, PRE); p1's figure is at map cell 13,31 (tile 5 of the 33x33 ring) = the row `13 31 220 60 60 People1 0 2 1 A` of the play desk's events.txt.
# RULES COVERED: `Find me` appears with a human seat and the tuning row camera_follow=1, and not with camera_follow=0; pressing it aims the cursor camera_lead (4) cells beyond the figure along the view direction (yaw 180 = north: 13,27; yaw 90: 17,31); camera_lead 0 aims at the figure itself;
#   it moves nothing when the camera is a free camera (mode 3), when the cursor possesses an entity other than the editor's hero_01 (hero_01, the state of every fresh editor launch, is let go of like the engine key 9 does), or when the tuning is off; a STOPPED game never snaps by itself; a RUNNING game snaps once when it becomes the human's turn and NOT during the pets' turns.
# NEGATIVES carry a positive control: each guard case is followed by the same press with the guard removed, which MUST move the cursor.
# NOT COVERED: that the engine really re-renders from these writes (live, with PNGs), the figure cell while it walks (dsk_driver pins the walk).
RESULTS | ../results/dsk_camera.txt
ENV | LC_ALL | C

CASE    | setup
SCRATCH |
MKDIR   | h/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x
COPY    | &.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/raw_to_png.+x | h/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/raw_to_png.+x
COPYDIR | @.apps/deskopoly | app | state,shots
MKDIR   | app/deskopoly-pchq/pieces/system/maps/deskopoly/play
MKDIR   | edit/state/world
MKDIR   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/world_01
MKDIR   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01
MKDIR   | edit/board/state
MKDIR   | edit/state/games/deskopoly/game
MKDIR   | sess/pieces/system
MKDIR   | sess/pieces/apps/player_app
WRITE   | edit/state/world/switches.txt | running=0\n
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/world_01/state.txt | map_id=deskopoly\ndesk_id=board\n
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
WRITE   | edit/board/state/ui.txt | bv_session=$T/sess\n
WRITE   | sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | focused_project_id=x\nselector_x=23\nselector_y=6\ncam_pan_z=21\ncam_pan_x=3\n
WRITE   | sess/pieces/apps/player_app/interact_relay.txt |
COPY    | &.widgits/_shared-lib/harness/fixtures/dsk_tradeui_ledger.txt | edit/state/games/deskopoly/game/ledger.txt
SPAWN   | OWN | /usr/bin/sleep | 600
ENV     | GAME_OWNER_PID | $OWN
SPAWN   | DRV | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_driver.+x | $T/h | $T/app | $T/edit
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | a game was in progress | 8000 | the-driver-continues-the-game-from-the-ledger
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \nhuman_turn=1\n | p1-human-is-to-act
WAIT_HAS | app/deskopoly-pchq/pieces/system/maps/deskopoly/play/events.txt | 13 31 220 60 60 People1 0 2 1 A | 8000 | p1s-figure-stands-at-map-cell-13-31
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=23\npos_y=6\n | the-cursor-is-where-the-owner-left-it-NO-snap-in-a-STOPPED-game
EXPECT_FILE | $T/sess/pieces/apps/player_app/interact_relay.txt |  | and-nothing-was-nudged
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | label=Find me | a-human-seat-with-camera_follow-1-has-the-Find-me-button

CASE    | find
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 6000 | Find-me-aims-the-cursor-4-cells-beyond-the-figure-along-the-view-direction-yaw-180-is-north
EXPECT_HAS | $T/sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | selector_x=13\nselector_y=27\n | the-board-selector-mirror-follows-so-the-next-arrow-starts-from-here
EXPECT_HAS | $T/sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | cam_pan_z=21\ncam_pan_x=3\n | the-other-lines-of-bv_state-are-untouched
EXPECT_HAS | $T/sess/pieces/apps/player_app/interact_relay.txt | 126\n | exactly-the-redraw-nudge-was-appended
EXPECT_FILE | $T/sess/pieces/apps/player_app/interact_relay.txt | 126\n | and-nothing-else
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n | the-xelector-keeps-its-other-lines
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | camera: here is your figure | 3000 | the-popup-says-so

CASE    | yaw
WRITE   | sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | focused_project_id=x\nselector_x=23\nselector_y=6\ncam_yaw=90\n
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=17\npos_y=31\n | 6000 | yaw-90-looks-east-so-the-cursor-is-aimed-4-cells-east-of-the-figure

CASE    | lead0
WRITE   | app/tuning.pdl | TUNE | camera_follow | 1 | x | 1\nTUNE | camera_lead | 0 | x | 4\n
WRITE   | sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | focused_project_id=x\nselector_x=23\nselector_y=6\n
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=31\n | 6000 | camera_lead-0-aims-at-the-figure-itself
WRITE   | app/tuning.pdl | TUNE | camera_follow | 1 | x | 1\nTUNE | camera_lead | 4 | x | 4\n

CASE    | free
WRITE   | sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | focused_project_id=x\nselector_x=23\nselector_y=6\ncamera_mode=3\n
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | free camera in use | 6000 | the-press-was-handled-and-says-why-nothing-moved
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=23\npos_y=6\n | NEGATIVE-a-free-camera-mode-3-is-never-overridden
WRITE   | sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | focused_project_id=x\nselector_x=23\nselector_y=6\ncamera_mode=2\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 6000 | CONTROL-the-same-press-with-camera_mode-2-moves-the-cursor

CASE    | possess
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=pet_01\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | the cursor is possessing pet_01 | 6000 | the-press-was-handled-and-says-why
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=23\npos_y=6\n | NEGATIVE-a-cursor-possessing-another-entity-the-owners-choice-is-not-moved
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | possessed_id=pet_01\n | and-keeps-its-possession
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 6000 | CONTROL-not-possessing-it-moves
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=8\npos_y=8\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=hero_01\nlast_possessed_id=hero_01\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 6000 | a-fresh-editor-launch-possesses-hero_01-the-snap-lets-go-of-it-and-moves
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | possessed_id=none\nlast_possessed_id=hero_01\n | like-key-9-possession-is-none-and-last_possessed_id-is-kept-so-9-jumps-back

CASE    | tuning_off
WRITE   | app/tuning.pdl | TUNE | camera_follow | 0 | x | 1\nTUNE | camera_lead | 4 | x | 4\n
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | speed_next | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | speed: slow | 6000 | the-popup-was-republished-with-the-tuning-off
EXPECT_LACKS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | Find me | NEGATIVE-the-owner-turned-it-off-so-there-is-no-Find-me-button
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | speed_next | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | speed: fast | 6000 | FENCE-the-find_me-line-before-this-one-was-handled
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=23\npos_y=6\n | NEGATIVE-a-typed-find_me-with-the-tuning-off-moves-nothing
WRITE   | app/tuning.pdl | TUNE | camera_follow | 1 | x | 1\nTUNE | camera_lead | 4 | x | 4\n
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | speed_next | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | label=Find me | 6000 | CONTROL-with-the-tuning-on-the-button-is-back
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 6000 | CONTROL-and-it-moves-the-cursor

CASE    | turn_change
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
WRITE   | sess/pieces/system/bv_state.txt | focused_project_id=x\nselector_x=23\nselector_y=6\n
WRITE   | sess/pieces/apps/player_app/interact_relay.txt |
WRITE   | edit/state/world/switches.txt | running=1\n
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 6000 | the-game-RUNS-and-it-is-the-humans-turn-so-the-camera-snaps-by-itself
WAIT_HAS | sess/pieces/apps/player_app/interact_relay.txt | 126\n | 3000 | with-one-nudge
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
SLEEP   | 1500
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=23\npos_y=6\n | NEGATIVE-the-same-turn-snaps-only-ONCE-the-owner-can-move-the-camera-while-the-game-waits
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 9000 | the-FIRST-auto-snap-of-a-driver-run-is-repeated-once-about-6-s-later-the-editor-relaunch-resets-the-cursor-after-the-driver-started
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
SLEEP   | 1500
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=23\npos_y=6\n | NEGATIVE-and-only-ONCE-there-is-no-third-snap-in-the-same-turn
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | find_me | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | camera: here is your figure | 3000 | RUNNING-game-Find-me-answers-in-the-popup
SLEEP   | 1500
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | camera: here is your figure | and-the-answer-STAYS-past-the-loops-your-turn-text-1.5-s-later
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=13\npos_y=27\n | 3000 | and-Find-me-moved-the-cursor-in-a-running-game-too
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | speed_next | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | roll | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/games/deskopoly/game/ledger.txt | to=33;card=fund:5;keep=fund | 8000 | p1-rolls-to-33
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | label=End turn | 12000 | and-the-walk-ends-with-an-End-turn-button
RUN | $T/app/ops/+x/deskopoly_ctl.+x | end | $T/edit/state/games/deskopoly
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ncurrent=p2\n | 12000 | the-turn-passes-to-the-pet-p2
WRITE   | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | entity_type=xelector\npos_x=23\npos_y=6\npos_z=17\npossessed_id=none\n
SLEEP   | 2300
WAIT_HAS | edit/state/games/deskopoly/game/ledger.txt | EVENT\p5\pp2\proll\p | 3000 | VACUITY-the-pet-p2-really-acted-inside-the-window-so-a-pet-snap-would-have-shown
EXPECT_LACKS | $T/edit/state/game_ui.txt | \ncurrent=p1\n | VACUITY-it-is-still-a-pets-turn-after-the-wait
EXPECT_HAS | $T/edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=23\npos_y=6\n | NEGATIVE-a-PET-turn-does-not-move-the-camera
WAIT_HAS | edit/edit-pchq/pieces/xelector_01/state.txt | pos_x=1\npos_y=18\n | 40000 | CONTROL-when-p1-is-up-again-the-camera-snaps-to-p1s-NEW-tile-33-cell-1-22-aimed-4-north
